Step 1: mkdir -p hub/WAI-Hub/advisors/octo/reports. Step 2: Create hub/tools/octo_brief.py. Structure: (a) Imports: json, os, glob, datetime, pathlib.Path. (b) Define HUB_DIR, and paths: GARDENER_STATE, SPINNER_DATA, CARTOLOGIST_STATE, CARTOLOGIST_DECISIONS, QM_INVENTORY, SIGNALS_DIR, OCTO_DIR, REPORTS_DIR. Use the post-rename paths (spinner/spoke_spinner.json, cartologist/) — with fallback to lathe/compass if rename not yet applied. (c) Helper load_json(path): return json.loads(Path(path).read_text()) if Path(path).exists() else {}. (d) load_decisions(path): read JSONL, return list of dicts. (e) check_council_readiness(): for each of gardener/spinner/cartologist/quartermaster, try to load their scan_state.json — check last_scan_at or last_brief_at field is within 25 hours of now; catch FileNotFoundError as False. Return dict {gardener:bool, spinner:bool, cartologist:bool, quartermaster:bool, all_ready:bool}. (f) compute_fleet_health(gardener_state): count spokes by status. Load yesterday's brief for trend: try REPORTS_DIR/strategic-brief-{yesterday}.json; compare today green_count to yesterday; return 'improving'/'stable'/'degrading'. Return {total_spokes:N, green:N, yellow:N, red:N, no_wai:N, trend:str}. (g) compute_portfolio(spinner_data): count spokes by shift_direction; find top 3 by urgency desc. Return {growth:N, maintain:N, revenue:N, research:N, sunset:N, top_urgency:[{spoke_id,urgency,shift}]}. (h) compute_decision_pressure(decisions, signals_dir): count len(list(Path(signals_dir).glob('*.json'))) for pending; count deferred=[d for d in decisions if d.get('action')=='defer']; count today_approved=[d for d in decisions if d.get('action')=='approve' and d.get('ts','')[:10]==today]. Return {pending_signals:N, deferred_decisions:N, approved_today:N}. (i) compute_inventory_alerts(qm_inventory): if qm_inventory empty return {stale_work:0, signal_overload:0, orphan_spokes:0, total_anomalies:0}. Count anomalies by type from qm_inventory['anomalies']. Return counts. (j) compute_strategic_focus(gardener_state, spinner_data): join by spoke_id. Select spokes where urgency >= 4 AND status not in ['GREEN']. Sort by urgency desc, take top 3. For each, generate recommended_action string: if health RED and shift growth -> 'Urgent: high-priority growth spoke in RED health — needs immediate attention'; if health YELLOW and shift growth -> 'Growth spoke lagging — health check before next sprint'; if health RED -> 'RED health blocking progress — remediate first'; else -> 'High urgency — monitor closely'. Return list of {spoke_id, urgency, shift, health_status, recommended_action}. (k) main(): load all inputs; now=datetime.datetime.utcnow(); today=str(datetime.date.today()); compute all sections; write REPORTS_DIR/strategic-brief-{today}.json with full schema; write REPORTS_DIR/latest.md as markdown (see schema); write OCTO_DIR/scan_state.json; print summary to stdout. (l) Brief JSON schema: {generated_at, council_readiness, fleet_health_summary, portfolio_summary, decision_pressure, inventory_alerts, strategic_focus, raw_inputs:{gardener_last_run, spinner_last_scored, cartologist_last_scan, quartermaster_last_scan}}. (m) latest.md format (under 30 lines): '# Octo Strategic Brief — {today}

## Fleet Health
{green}/{total} GREEN | {yellow} YELLOW | {red} RED | trend: {trend}

## Strategic Focus
{for each focus item: - {spoke_id} (urgency {N}, {shift}): {recommended_action}}

## Decision Pressure
{pending} signals pending | {deferred} deferred decisions

## Inventory
{total_anomalies} anomalies detected {or None}

## Council Status
- [x/] Gardener: {fresh/stale}
- [x/] Spinner: {fresh/stale}
- [x/] Cartologist: {fresh/stale}
- [x/] Quartermaster: {fresh/stale}'. Step 3: In hub/WAI-Hub/advisors/gardener/scripts/wheel-tender.sh: add 'python3 {HUB_TOOLS_PATH}/octo_brief.py' as the LAST step in the post-tend pipeline, using the same invocation pattern as other tools. Step 4: Move this lug to completed/.
